    "@es": "Hablar de seguridad",
    "@en": "Talk about security"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Arbeidsmiljø** es el entorno laboral. **Arbeidsulykke** es un accidente de trabajo; **rapportere** significa informar oficialmente de algo.",
     "@en": "**Arbeidsmiljø** is the working environment. **Arbeidsulykke** is an accident at work; **rapportere** means officially reporting something."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Pedir permiso",
    "@en": "Request permission"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Få lov til å + infinitivo** significa tener permiso para hacer algo. **Få snakke med** puede significar que te permiten hablar con alguien.",
     "@en": "**Få lov til å + infinitivo** means having permission to do something. **Få snakke med** can mean you're allowed to talk to someone."
    }
   ]
